E
"lever"
"This small grey lever is inset into a small niche beside the portcullis. 

"
E
"__MOBS__"
"mob 771 Rasvaro, an undead dark paladin

mob 774 Bornas, an undead arch-cleric

mob 776 Tnelazu, an ice demon lord

mob 129 Maztlan, an ashy figure in a black robe

mob 983 a dark spectre

mob 987 the Tourmaline Guardian, a Guardian

mob 988 the Crimson Guardian, a Guardian

mob 989 the Jade Adept, a slender woman cloaked in a jade-coloured robe

mob 982 Ghadl Savan, a dark, broad-shouldered wizard

"
E
"__AREA__"
"The area is in 2 stages


stage 1: the walls and towers


step 1: kill the spectre wandering the walls.  this opens one of the

trapdoors.  as you kill each inhabitant of the towers, the fights get harder,

and the next trapdoor is opened.  Eventually you fight the ice demon in the NE

corner tower, which opens a grate below the tower.  Through that grate you

enter stage 2


stage 2: the guardians and final battle


You fight the tourmaline guardian, crimson guardian, and jade adept to reveal

an astral staircase ascending to a dark wizard's domain.

"
E
"__OBJECTS__"
"object 820 a two-handed sword 'Wrath'

object 2089 an antiquated mithril helm

object 771 a dagger 'Liche-Tongue'

object 989 a jade-coloured cloak

object 992 a jade pendant

object 1360 a bentwood staff

object 1334 a brown runic cloak

"
E
"cobweb corner cranny"
"The cobwebs glisten freshly, the remnants of foolish insects dangling.

"
A
"__OPEN_PORT_CODE__"
""
"if( !is_open( find_room( 88000 ), south ) ) {

  send_to_room( #south, find_room( 88000 ) );

  send_to_room( #north, find_room( 36001 ) );

  open( find_room( 88000 ), south );

  wait( 4 );

  acode( find_room( 88000 ), 2 );

  }

"
E
"south"
"The portcullis to the south opens with a clank and the winding of chains.

"
E
"north"
"The portcullis to the north opens with a clank and the winding of chains.

"
!
