#88005
"North-West Tower of Narak"
"This watchtower adorns the northwest corner of the city of Narak, and is lit

by an eerie green glow.  Shelves of books adorn the walls, most likely a new

addition as the cityguard is mostly illiterate.  Rich tapestries adorn the

walls as well, extravagant for a watchtower.  A winding stone staircase

descends into darkness below.  The view out of the west window overlooks a

land devoid of life.

"
