#88024
"North-East Tower of Narak"
"This tower room is coated entirely with a three-inch layer of ice, and is bare

save a strange, cold throne in the center of the room.  A cold, white light

fills the room from a magical fire set in an otherwise empty sconce.  From

somewhere intangible a hollow, ringing laughter issues forth, chilling your

very blood.  A trapdoor leads down and out of the tower.

"
